Date: Fri, 19 Jan 2024 13:13:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 497/913] dts: stm32: add frequency monitor to STM32MP2 SoC
 files

Adds HSE frequency monitor to STM32MP2 SoC files.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 61dad817a2af1d886796b5c031eed762b68e60b6 dts: stm32: add frequency monitor to STM32MP2 SoC files]
Signed-off-by: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I3de363a47157f739bcf1f893f2b47e66e359354d
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/570782
Domain-Review: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Thomas BOURGOIN <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp211.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp231.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp251.dtsi | 8 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 24 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp211.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp211.dtsi
index 73a272c06..97baab505 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp211.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp211.dtsi
@@ -28,6 +28,14 @@
 		};
 	};
 
+	hse_monitor: hse-monitor {
+		compatible = "st,freq-monitor";
+		counter = <&lptimer1 1 5 1 1>;
+		clocks = <&rcc HSE_CK>, <&rcc HSI_CK>;
+		clock-names = "hse", "hsi";
+		status = "disabled";
+	};
+
 	psci {
 		compatible = "arm,psci-1.0";
 		method = "smc";
